Package: miadi-claude
Version: 0.1.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, jq, git
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: One command that sets up Claude Code for an account on a Miadi host
 miadi-claude setup, run by each account, installs the
 miadi-session-observability plugin and removes the hook entries that
 plugin replaces from that account's settings.json, so a session is
 captured and bound to its terminal with nothing to wire by hand.
 miadi-claude status says what is set up. The package also brings the
 commands the capture hooks call. Installing it changes no home directory.
 Claude Code itself and its sign-in stay with each account.
